        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo PLP-211, Outswing Door Security Pin Latch Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis steel security door latch protector features an anti spread security pin.  The 1/2\" solid pin is welded to the back side of the security plate leaving no visible point of attack from the outside. When the door is closed the security pin embeds into the door frame to prevent spreading of the door from the frame. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIt is 11\" high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) on residential or commercial door applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/outswing-door-stainless-security-pin-latch-guard-don-jo-plp-111-630\"><b>Stainless Steel Pin Latch Guard</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-PLP-211_size.gif?v=1704354713\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo PLP-211 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with standard 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo PLP-211 Security Pin Latch Guard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 12 Gauge (.104\")</li>\r\n<li>Security Pin: .313\" x .500\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/4\" (.250\") </li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 4 each 5/16-18 x 2-1/4\" Carriage bolt with Acorn nuts and washers.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PLP-211.pdf?v=1704262233\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo PLP-211 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Outswing Door Security Pin Latch Guard, Don-Jo PLP-211",
                "description": "Don-Jo PLP-211 pin latch protector. This steel security door latch protector features an anti spread security pin. It is 11 inches high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building). For use with key-in knobs / levers (door knobs or levers that use a key to unlock) on residential or commercial door applications. Non-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Fits doors with either  2-3/8 or 2-3/4  backset.  ",
                "keywords": "DJO-PLP-211 Outswing Door Security Plates, front Door Security Latch Guard, Don-Jo PLP-211 latch protectors, Don-Jo PLP-211 door security plates, don-joe front Door Latch Guards, anti vandal plates, door Security plates, Outswing Door Security Pin Latch Guards, anti spread pins, security door pins, Don-Jo PLP-211-SL, Don-Jo PLP-211-DU, Don-Jo PLP-211-BP, Don-Jo PLP-211-626, Don-Jo PLP-211-CP,"
